WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.787
Video 13. Bank reconciliation.

00:00:03.987 --> 00:00:08.470
Tamara chopda ma tame kareli darek bank entry
dekhay chhe.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.999
Bank statement ma dekhay chhe ke bank ma shu
pahonchyu, ane kyare.

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:17.843
Bank reconciliation ma, tame darek entry ne
eni bank date aapo chho.

00:00:17.773 --> 00:00:21.364
Pachhi Balance as per Bank statement saathe
male chhe.

00:00:21.664 --> 00:00:29.902
N dabavo to Banking khule chhe: cheque printing,
cheque register, ane bank reconciliation.

00:00:29.932 --> 00:00:37.056
R etle Bank Reconciliation. Bank account
pasand karo: HDFC Bank.

00:00:38.136 --> 00:00:44.260
Hisaab chopda ni darek bank entry batave chhe:
taarikh, cheque number, ane rakam.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:51.593
Bank Date ni column khaali chhe. Etle Balance
as per Bank haji ₹8,00,000 chhe.

00:00:51.623 --> 00:01:00.030
Statement ma rent no cheque 5 April e chhe.
Bank Date ma 5-4 lakho, ane Enter.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:03.511
Statement ni darek entry ni bank date lakho.

00:01:05.068 --> 00:01:12.022
Furniture no ₹30,000 no cheque haji statement
ma nathi. Eni bank date khaali rahe chhe.

00:01:12.052 --> 00:01:19.206
Have Balance as per Bank ₹6,24,000 chhe. Ene
statement saathe sarkhavo.

00:01:19.236 --> 00:01:24.020
Esc, ane fari kholo: list ma fakt baaki cheque
rahe chhe.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:35.185
Q dabavo to Cheque Register khule chhe: 100 cheques ni
ek book. 3 issued, 2 reconciled, 97 unused.

00:01:35.215 --> 00:01:41.130
Enter thi darek cheque: status, taarikh,
party, rakam ane bank date.

00:01:41.665 --> 00:01:45.548
Chopda pramane: ₹5,94,000.

00:01:45.478 --> 00:01:52.409
Je cheque clear nathi thayo e umero. Bank
pramane: ₹6,24,000.

00:01:52.609 --> 00:01:57.480
Have pachhi: Day Book, ane darek voucher sudhi
drill-down.

